      "content": "It's understandable you're looking for solutions for your kidney stones, but high doses of Vitamin C might not be the best approach for this specific issue. In some cases, very high intakes of Vitamin C can actually increase the risk of certain types of kidney stones. It is crucial that you discuss any changes to your diet or supplement regimen with your doctor or a nephrologist to ensure it is safe and appropriate for your kidney health.",
      "source": "target",
