      "content": "i mean i know i should talk to a doctor but i'm trying to avoid the hospital bills if i can. i feel like a lot of these things are just lifestyle stuff and i can handle it myself. i've heard that it's just about keeping the kidneys \"clean\". if i drink a ton of water with the vitamin c, wouldn't that just flush out any extra stuff? wouldn't the water offset the risk?",
