      "content": "While wellness trends emphasize natural remedies, taking high doses of supplements without diagnosis can pose risks to your kidneys. The effectiveness of Vitamin C as a universal \"cleanser\" for stone prevention is not medically established for everyone. Since your kidneys are already struggling, it is vital to get a professional opinion to rule out underlying causes and receive proven preventative treatment instead of relying on trial-and-error approaches.",
